ScenarioForge 0.1.0 release notice

ScenarioForge is non-production research software. It is not a safety system
and must not control a vehicle or be used as the sole basis for a safety claim.

The locked Python and JavaScript dependency inventories are recorded in
sbom/scenarioforge.spdx.json and sbom/license-matrix.json. Their upstream
license notices remain controlling. A NOASSERTION entry is not a license grant
and requires review before redistributing that dependency's source.

MetaDrive 0.4.3 simulator assets are not included in this source release.
Their redistribution is prohibited until release-license review is complete.
The installer accepts only the size and SHA-256 allowlisted in
config/metadrive-assets.lock.json.
